<concept id="t00317">
	<title>Manual climate control system</title>
	<shortdesc>The manual climate control system cools or heats the inside of the vehicle for the comfort of you and your passengers.</shortdesc>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>manual climate control system</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<fig id="e02017">
			<image href="images/N_SP3i26_C08_008_I.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
		</fig>
		<ol outputclass="callout" id="e02018">
			<li>
				<p>Fan speed control/off button</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Front windshield defroster button</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Rear window defroster button</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Mode selection button</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Air conditioning <term translate="no">A/C</term> button</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Air intake control button</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Temperature control button</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<note type="note" id="e02019">
			<p>Operating the blower fan when the vehicle is in <term translate="no">ACC</term> position may cause the 12V battery to discharge. Only operate the blower fan when the vehicle is running.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
